    "captions": [
      {
        "t": 0,
        "text": "Sunday 28 February. About 76 ATF agents gather at the Bellmead Civic Center, east of Waco, for a raid code-named Showtime."
      },
      {
        "t": 4,
        "text": "Inside Mount Carmel, Koresh tells the undercover agent Robert Rodriguez that the ATF are coming. Rodriguez leaves and warns his commanders that surprise is lost."
      },
      {"t": 25, "text": "The raid goes ahead. The convoy sets off, two cattle trailers hiding the agents."},
      {
        "t": 33,
        "text": "Three Texas National Guard helicopters lift off from the TSTC airfield to come in from behind as a diversion."
      },
      {
        "t": 45,
        "text": "About 9.45 am the trailers pull up at the front door. Shooting starts almost at once; who fired first was never settled."
      },
      {
        "t": 50,
        "text": "Agents climb ladders onto the roof towards the armoury. The gunfight lasts about two hours, until a sheriff's lieutenant negotiates a ceasefire by phone."
      }
    ]
